  "summary": "Graft builds a codebase understanding graph once and writes it into the repo as a folder of linked markdown files, one node per system, API, or concept. graft init registers an MCP server exposing six tools: graft_find_code, graft_file_api, graft_trace_calls, graft_find_all, graft_repo_map, and graft_check_freshness. Evidence coverage: 120 of 272 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
